      "id": "blk_af4df1bf",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "独立于瑝珑诸行政司法军事部门之外的机构，最高长官称之为“指挥使”。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9c3bee5e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "镇抚司直接听命于瑝珑龙主，有权不经瑝珑诸司衙门同意,介入并针对任何案件、官员和罪犯进行调查，有理论上的“先斩后奏”权力。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_7e65d3c5",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "镇抚司常年经手侦办复杂案件，镇抚司因此拥有瑝珑之中特殊的专门针对共鸣者的手段。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
